<p>然后在运行的 JVM 参数里添加一些参数：</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>-XX:MetaspaceSize=64m
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=64m
-verbose:class
-verbose:gc
